Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NLet's break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydrogen.\NWhat does that give us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By mole,\Nwe're looking at 63 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-three? Wow.\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a big bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My next step's gotta be oxygen.\NOxygen, 26 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-six.\NThere you have your water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Carbon, 9 percent.\NCarbon, 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For a total of 98 percent.\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NNitrogen, 1 .25 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NOne-point-two-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NThat brings you\Nto 99 and a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which only leaves you\Nwith the trace elements
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,down where\Nthe magic happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a minute. What about\Ncalcium? Calcium's not a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NGot a whole skeleton\Nto account for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN: You would think, right?\NWALTER: Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NCalcium.\NCalcium's only 0.25 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That low?\NUh-huh. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, l never\Nwould've thought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so where does iron fit in?\Nlron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NWow, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,0.00004 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You can't have\Nhemoglobin without iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it don't take much.\NNo doubt. Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NAh, sodium.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN: Sodium, 0.04.\N[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NPhosphorus, 0.1 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NPoint-one-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So the whole thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,adds up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,99.888042 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We are 0.1 1 1 958 percent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposedly that's everything.\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know,\Nit just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,lt just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,lt seems like something's\Nmissing, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NThere's got to be more\Nto a human being than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[FLUSHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,l hate these shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoes make me look like\Nl should be changing bedpans,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,like l should be\Nsqueaking around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing soup to some\Ndisgusting old person,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,then take the bus home\Nto my 1 6 cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you\Nwearing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,l like the support. My arches\Nhappen to be extremely arch-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you call me, like,\Nin two minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,l gotta go take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh. Female?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like it's any\Nof your business, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be quick about it.\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and, um,\Nplease don't say, "Yo."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't know\Nhow much l hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed a spot, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you be up\Non that ladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more than welcome\Nto take over for me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't see why you don't get\NWalt to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,\Nthere's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So um, l'm, uh, l'm working\Non this new short story
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's this stoner\Ncharacter in it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and l'm trying to...um. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, actually,\Nlet me back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you smoked your fair share
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,of pot in college,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean,\Nyou at least tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,l perhaps tried it. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember it\Nhaving an effect on your mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like,\Nchanging it in any major way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,lt made me more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l mostly remember
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it made me lightheaded,\Nthat's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,l was just\Nwondering if--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,lf it maybe could, um. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just a character thing\Nl'm stuck on. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter, Jr.'s on pot?\NWhat? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What would make you even--?\NWhere's he getting it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie.\NSeriously. ls it this Louis person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do\Nabout this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie,\Nyou need to look me in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,l am strictly asking
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,about a story that l'm writing,\Nthat's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right hand to God,\NWalter Jr. is not on pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly not as far\Nas l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as far as you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[TOlLET FLUSHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn around\Nand look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This. . . This here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,l wouldn't do this\Nto my worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is degrading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You hope l'll make it easy\Nand just drop dead, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But l won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So either kill me,\Nor let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have it in you,\NWalter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He told Emilio and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l came by\Nto sell your meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what, did you\Nthreaten him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you beat it out of him?\NNot even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What else did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much everything\Nhe could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You were his high-school\Nteacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One time you taught\Nabout carbon dioxide
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,by making grape soda\Nin class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a son\Nwho's retarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,or in a wheelchair\Nor something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,lt shouldn't come across\Nas some news flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That partner of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he's got a big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know what you think\Nyou're doing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,this line of work\Ndoesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So l should just let you go,\Nthen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just unlock you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and adiós, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't see\Nwhat real choice you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,lf it's between that\Nand cold-blooded murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,your real problem's\Nsitting upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo, l'm trying to pinch one\Noff in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me some privacy,\Nwould you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NWhat the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole. What--?\NYou told him my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Says who, him?\NMy name, where l work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You told him about my son.\NHey, don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn junkie.\NNo, give me that. That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going down the toilet.\NWatch it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's worth 40 grand,\Nyou stupid shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's worth nothing\Nwhen you smoke it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the toilet!\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.\N[TOlLET FLUSHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse, where the hell\Ndo you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, man. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got work to do.\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You-- You got work to do.\Nl did my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that obscenity l spent\Nthe last two hours cleaning up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your contribution?\NKiss my pink ass, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l didn't ask for any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How am l supposed\Nto live here now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole house smells like\Ntoe cheese and dry cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you didn't follow\Nmy instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, heil Hitler,\Nbitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you\Nsomething else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We flipped a coin,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me. You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Coin flip is sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is waiting for you\Nin that basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,as per the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking do it, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what she said.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, l think\Nwe have some of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll have\Nto try them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?\NSeven and a half, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know.\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have these in black?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways,\Nso like l was saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,l went to the party the other\Nnight. Yeah, Tony was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.99,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where have you been?\Nl called you two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NSorry, baby, l'm, uh,\Nkind of busy here. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, kind of a lot, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's a delicate subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So l need you to focus, and--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sit down! Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry, babe, l'm just\Nin the middle of something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down! Sit your ass down,\Ncomprende? You too, sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKlNG SPANlSH]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm back, babe. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter Jr.\NYeah, what about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Marijuana. He's smoking it.\NBullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, his own mother\Nseems to think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler told you that?\NShe inferred it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She inferred it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She strongly inferred it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "Doctor, my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,suffers from\Nerectile dysfunction."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come on.\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,l want you to talk to him.\NWalt should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, Skyler, better yet.\NShe'll kick his butt\Nup and down the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it ought to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, tell him\Nsome horror stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe show him\Nsome autopsy pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,An autopsy of a pot overdose?\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know, baby,\Nit's just that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,l figure his dad should be the\None doing this thing,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, he respects you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right.\NWell, listen, l mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll swing by their place\Nafter work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Scare him straight.\NYeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's my sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. Muah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,SALESWOMAN:\NExcuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you need to be wearing\Nfooties before you try those on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm extremely clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well,\Nl'd really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry about that.\NYeah, l'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,SALESWOMAN:\NYou know, l hid a pair for you\Nlast week, gray ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My manager found them and we\Nput them back on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SASHA DOBSON'S\N"WlTHOUT YOU" PLAYlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[AMBULANCE SlREN WAlLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAR HORN HONKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK: What do you think?\NWALT JR. : About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This look like\Na nice place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you'd like\Nto live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure about that?\NYeah, pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.47,0:16:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,l thought we were going to\NCold Stone Creamery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, well,\Nwe took a little detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure we'll come\Nover here and check\Nout how the other half lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This here is what we call\Nthe Crystal Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who lives\Nin the palace? Meth-heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty, skeevy meth-heads
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,who'd sell their grandma's\Ncoochie for a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think that's funny?\NThat's funny, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.\NEvery one of these
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,miserable wastes of skin\Ngot started how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think they started?\Nl don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think it was\Nthey were all doing\Nbefore they graduated
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to shooting meth\Nin their dicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A gateway drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dollars to doughnuts,\Nand l shit you not,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that gateway drug was\Nmarijuana, every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?\NUm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you\Ntelling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l love you,\Nyou little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And, hey, l was young once,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's a messed-up place,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, just this, uh,\None time, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you, princess.\NGet over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAR HORN HONKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't make me\Nget out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NSee what\Nl'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, l ain't holding, okay?\NDid l say you could open your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And hands off the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Other side. Go around the other\Nside, talk to my friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name,\Nsweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy.\NHANK: Wendy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How much you charge\Nfor a windy, Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,l ain't doing him, he's a kid.\NJesus, was that my question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think so hard,\Nit's gonna hurt your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you on the pipe\Nor on the needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.\NShow us your teeth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Wendy,\Nlet's see those pearly whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. See that?\NPipe, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigtime, bigtime on the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something\Nyou wanna ask Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever smoke anything else,\NWendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sausages don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Seriously,\Ntell my friend here\Nhow you got started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably used to be, what,\Nlike a Girl Scout
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,or probably sang\Nin the church choir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, like,\Nhandicapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke his leg\Nplaying football.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a QB.\NGot an arm like a howitzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, Wendy,\Nyou smoke pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you got some?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, hoof it, get lost.\NGet out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, fair warning,\Nnext time l'm gonna bust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NShut the door.\NShut the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock it.\NLock it, lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cop and some\Nfootball player\Nmessing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NThey ask about me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No,\Nl think they just wanted pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NRight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,HOOKER:\NShit, left my root beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[BEEPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER: Hello?\NHey, sweetie, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, l'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The time, it just, ha--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,lt just-- lt completely\Ngot away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm just, ha...uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My fault, my fault.\NBogdan just kept me here late,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, doing some inventory,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.18,0:21:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and l, um, l-- l should've just--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,l-l gotta learn to say,\Nyou know, "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But, um. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky? You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at the car wash?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l seriously doubt that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,since you quit two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,l called Bogdan,\Nlooking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite an earful he gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, l'll come home\Nand we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.35,0:22:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't think so, Walt.\NHoney...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you just\Nstay there tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler? Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,KRAZY-8:\NWalter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, l'm kind of hungry\Ndown here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALTER COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.33,0:24:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,l didn't think\Nyou were coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.38,0:24:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How long was l out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten, 1 5 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:25:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,l've never seen someone\Nknock themselves out\Njust by coughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.65,0:25:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You breathe in the same shit\Nyou used on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.57,0:25:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,l've got lung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.04,0:25:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.85,0:25:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll go make you\Nanother sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.06,0:26:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\Nlt's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.07,0:26:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that would be\Nthe way to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.07,0:26:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.28,0:26:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,l suppose it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.82,0:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.37,0:26:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you being a chemist\Nand all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:27:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So that name...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.47,0:27:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.94,0:27:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do l really\Nhave to call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.81,0:27:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't you have a real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.57,0:27:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Domingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.28,0:27:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's "Sunday," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.45,0:27:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd rather call you that,\Nif you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.04,0:27:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,l can't say\Nl ever liked it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.75,0:27:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.76,0:27:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Domingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.14,0:27:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you from around town here\Nor someplace else?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.35,0:27:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Walter?\NYou getting to know me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.27,0:27:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is not gonna make it easier\Nfor you to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.15,0:27:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that l mind, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you keep telling me\Nthat l don't have it in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,l sure as hell am looking for\Nany reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.41,0:28:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, any good reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.89,0:28:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,l guess l'd start off by\Npromising that if you let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.81,0:28:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l won't come after you,\Nthat you'd be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.15,0:28:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,l guess l'd say\Nwhat happened between us
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.23,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's best for both parties\Nis we forget all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know that\Nanybody in my situation
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.12,0:28:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,would make promises\Nlike that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.95,0:28:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And, in my case,\Nthey happen to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.45,0:28:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what else can l tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.93,0:28:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.22,0:29:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've gotta convince me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.68,0:29:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're going nowhere\Nuntil you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.23,0:29:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.44,0:29:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm from here in town,\Nman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ABQ, born and bred.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.15,0:29:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.66,0:29:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Studied Business Administration\Nover at UNM,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.16,0:29:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,got my degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.70,0:29:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that, uh, come in handy\Nin the drug trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.67,0:29:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,lt doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.34,0:29:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,l was gonna study\Nmusic originally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even try out\Nfor Oberlin and Berklee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.47,0:29:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My pops talked me\Nout of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.97,0:29:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Said there was\Nno money in it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,unless l wind up\Nsome bullshit rock star,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.85,0:29:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and l didn't have\Na snowball chance of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.98,0:29:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What does your dad do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.57,0:29:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He owns Tampico Furniture
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,over on Menaul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.99,0:30:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute,\Nl know that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.70,0:30:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. That's. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's that-- That, uh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.42,0:30:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to have those--\NThose late-night--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.34,0:30:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The stupid commercials.\NThat they had, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.55,0:30:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him. Been doing\Nthem for over 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.80,0:30:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.\NHow did it go? lt was, uh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.85,0:30:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. lt was. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlNGlNG]\NDon't let shopping\NStrain your brain-o
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sing this short refrain-o
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our furniture is bueno\NOur furniture is bueno
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.86,0:30:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tampico is the name-o\NTampico is the name-o
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.03,0:30:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty moronic.\NBut what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.21,0:31:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it did tend\Nto stick in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you write that? Being\Nthe musician in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.05,0:31:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, no, man.\Nlt was my crazy uncle Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He sings it at bars,\Ntrying to pick up on women.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.02,0:31:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind, it's like saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.56,0:31:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hey, l wrote\N'Stairway to Heaven."'
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.11,0:31:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but at\NTampico Furniture, l. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,l think when my son\Nwas born
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.11,0:31:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that we bought\Nhis bassinet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.03,0:31:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.\NWe don't sell bassinets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.33,0:31:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's more of a specialty item.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We did use to sell cribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A crib, then, okay. A crib.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.42,0:31:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No, l remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.75,0:31:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,ln fact, l remember\Nrecognizing your dad
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.01,0:31:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,from those commercials.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.01,0:31:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Although he wasn't\Nanywhere near\Nas friendly in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.72,0:31:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.81,0:31:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he, uh, try selling you\Nthat extended warranty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he probably did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.94,0:32:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And l was probably\Ndumb enough to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was his big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.78,0:32:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask him\Nfor a glass of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.53,0:32:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd tell you you need\Nan extended warranty on the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.37,0:32:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you work there too?\NOnly my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until the day l said,\N"Fuck you," and quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,1 6 years ago,\Nhow old would you have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.97,0:32:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,lf it was after school,\Ntrust me, l was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.26,0:32:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Might have even helped\Nring you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.47,0:32:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your extended\Nwarranty on the crib.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.61,0:32:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.66,0:32:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,lt is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.41,0:32:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The paths we take, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.21,0:33:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[MUTTERS lNDlSTlNCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.19,0:33:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse know\Nyou've got cancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.86,0:33:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No one but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.49,0:33:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.37,0:33:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.20,0:33:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.37,0:33:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a conversation that l'm even\Nremotely ready to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.55,0:33:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're cooking meth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.63,0:33:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna leave money\Nfor your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.10,0:33:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, l mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.97,0:33:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll write you a check right now\Nif you let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.27,0:34:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like l said, Walter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.24,0:34:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,this line of work\Ndoesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.87,0:34:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.26,0:34:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.58,0:34:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll get the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.62,0:35:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.51,0:36:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.89,0:36:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.11,0:37:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No. No, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.74,0:37:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this.\NWhy are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.59,0:37:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CREAKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.35,0:37:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing the right thing,\NWalter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.91,0:37:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.62,0:37:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.51,0:38:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.43,0:38:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're not angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.69,0:38:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.81,0:38:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Angry at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.32,0:38:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.99,0:38:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Live and let live, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.49,0:38:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.91,0:38:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.91,0:38:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,l just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock me, Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.20,0:39:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment l do...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,are you gonna stick me\Nwith that broken piece of plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.87,0:39:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[YELLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.93,0:39:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALTER GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.86,0:39:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry, l'm sorry,\Nl'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.98,0:39:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry, l'm so sorry,\Nl'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.07,0:39:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.28,0:39:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.04,0:39:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.39,0:40:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.28,0:41:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.69,0:42:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHATTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.58,0:42:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NEverybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.62,0:42:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,l need you all to take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.54,0:42:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.55,0:42:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,l understand\Nthat Mr. White is feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.76,0:42:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a little under the weather\Nthis morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.26,0:42:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you folks
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.51,0:42:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,are going to have to be\Nmaking do with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.43,0:43:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are going to be watching\Na very interesting video
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.94,0:43:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,on carbon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.61,0:43:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Very important stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.90,0:43:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NSo, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.53,0:43:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NAh, it's a cook site.\NGotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody came way the hell\Nout here just to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.58,0:43:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire there could have started\Nby accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.54,0:43:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't think that was meant\Nto destroy evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.75,0:43:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NGot a couple of Dooley tracks\Nheaded away, towards the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.21,0:43:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what, they're in\Nsome kind of camper/lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.76,0:43:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They accidentally start a fire\Nand everybody FOs?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.05,0:43:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.89,0:43:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did that little\Nhair-gelled shit leave\Nhis car?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.14,0:43:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ay-yi-yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomey,\Nit's a culture in decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.31,0:43:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's a rich\Nand vibrant culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.48,0:43:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's a car that jumps\Nup and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.15,0:43:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.53,0:43:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You people used to be\Nconquistadors, for chrissake.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.95,0:44:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells like a Drakkar Noir\Nfactory in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.49,0:44:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,l already searched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.16,0:44:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.58,0:44:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.00,0:44:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up.\Nlf this here's a trap car,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.46,0:44:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,it's gonna take more than your\Ndumb white ass to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.92,0:44:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? You are talking to\Nthe trap-car master,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.01,0:44:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.26,0:44:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm Rain Man counting\Nhis toothpicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.85,0:44:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're like Rain Man.\NRetarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.02,0:44:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANK LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.86,0:44:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NYeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.90,0:44:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.86,0:44:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, zippy.\NAsshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.78,0:44:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of looks like meth\Nbut it's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.66,0:44:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it's too damn white.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.67,0:44:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what l'm thinking,\NGomey?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.71,0:44:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.\NSomebody croaked our snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.59,0:44:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NHey, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.34,0:44:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.56,0:45:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.75,0:45:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NI don't know. lt just...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.75,0:45:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,lt just doesn't it seem like--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.34,0:45:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.26,0:45:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.47,0:45:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.90,0:45:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.62,0:46:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing\Nbut chemistry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.70,0:46:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTOR WHlRRlNG LOUDLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.60,0:47:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.74,0:47:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nl have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.00,0:47:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
